# Local users (password "password"): alice=ENGINEER, bob=APPROVER, carol=ENGINEER+APPROVER, admin=ADMIN+OPS
@alice = Basic alice password
@bob = Basic bob password

### Create a short link (201; replay with same Idempotency-Key -> 200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{alice}}
Idempotency-Key: create-1

{"url": "https://example.com/some/long/path", "alias": "launch", "ttlSeconds": 86400}

### Redirect (302, public)
GET http://localhost:8080/launch

### Metadata (owner or admin only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/launch
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Analytics (owner or admin only; bob gets 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/launch/analytics
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Update destination / TTL
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/launch
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{alice}}

{"url": "https://example.org/v2", "ttlSeconds": 3600}

### SSRF guard (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{alice}}

{"url": "http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data"}

### Deactivate (204; redirect then returns 410)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/urls/launch
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Scenario graphs
GET http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/scenarios
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Start a run as alice (ENGINEER); copy the id into @runId
POST http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{alice}}

{"scenario": "GREENFIELD", "failureMode": "TRANSIENT"}

### Run snapshot
@runId = replace-me
GET http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Approve as bob (APPROVER). alice gets 403: no APPROVER role
POST http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{bob}}

{"stageId": "release", "comment": "CHG-1001"}

### Reject -> rollback
POST http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/reject
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{bob}}

{"stageId": "release", "comment": "not this week"}

### Amend requirements -> re-plan downstream
POST http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/amend
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{alice}}

{"artifact": "requirements", "changes": {"acceptanceCriteria": ["Links can be exported as CSV"]}, "reason": "PO scope change"}

### Safe-stop
POST http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/stop
Authorization: {{alice}}

### Audit trace (persisted in the database)
GET http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/runs/{{runId}}/trace
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Reliability metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/orchestrator/metrics
Authorization: {{bob}}

### Prometheus scrape (OPS role)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: Basic admin password
